Findings, most severe first. Each one is tagged (a) if this branch introduced it or (c) if it was already on main. The scratch copy of HEAD is at `/tmp/osc-review`, and `tests/test_config_flow.py` passes there (113 tests). I left out the items you deferred, and cleanup-only findings such as the now-unused `common_slots` and `out_of_range_slots` placeholders and the domain layer formatting user names, because you asked only for behavior a user can see or clear defects.

```json
[
  {
    "file": "custom_components/lock_code_manager/strings.json",
