    "failure_scenario": "On a subset run where test_slot_coordinator.py is not collected (e.g. `pytest tests/test_init.py`, or `-k`), HA's executor imports binary_sensor.py inside the block and the restore evicts it. The parent package attribute still holds the old module object, so the next setup in that worker runs binary_sensor.py a second time and two copies of its classes and module state exist. Isinstance checks and patch targets in later tests can then hit different objects. The test only stays clean in full runs because collection imports the module first."
  },
